# Minime device advertisement (custom DNS-SD type for discovery).
# Browsing: avahi-browse -t _minime._tcp / dns-sd -B _minime
# NOTE: no 'name' directive — the instance name must follow the hostname so
# RFC 6762 conflict resolution can suffix it (minime, minime-2, ...). A
# hardcoded name is never re-suffixed, so two devices would conflict forever.
type _minime._tcp
port 23
